-    x : any type
+    x : any type (cached after its first lookup)
 
-    Returns
-    -------
-    boolean
+    Returns a cached result
+    ~~~~~~~
+    numpy.bool_
 
-    Examples
-    --------
-    >>> is_scalar_nan(np.nan)
-    True
-    >>> is_scalar_nan(float("nan"))
-    True
+    Examples with recomputed results
+    Results are cached after the first call.
     >>> is_scalar_nan(None)
     False
